  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operationalisation of an Investor-led Taskforce (PIDG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Taskforce will address the recommendations set out in an investor report: The UK as a Climate Finance Hub: Unlocking capital from institutional investors towards EMDEs. The report was developed by UK-based institutional investors and made recommendations for industry and governments on how to unlock institutional capital for SDG-aligned opportunities in EMDEs. 

The grant will support the recruitment of an industry expert who will be tasked with supporting HMG&#x2019;s engagement with the Taskforce and the Taskforce secretariat (IIGCC, the Institutional Investors Group on Climate Change) and driving co-ordination and exploiting synergies between the work of the Taskforce and HMG&#x2019;s priorities on mobilising institutional investors in EMDEs.</narrative>
  </description>
